#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.select.assign:1 of
msgid "Add new columns to LiteFrame."
msgstr "向 LiteFrame 添加新列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.select.assign:3 of
msgid ""
"Existing columns whose names appear in *kwargs* are replaced in place "
"(preserving their position); new columns are appended in insertion order."
"  Each value may be a scalar, a callable receiving the frame, a "
":class:`LiteFrameExpr`, or a single-column LiteFrame."
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.select.assign of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.select.assign:8 of
msgid ""
"Column assignments as ``name=value`` pairs.  Names are normalized and "
"used as the output column names."
msgstr "列赋值为 ``name=value`` 对。名称被标准化并用作输出列名。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.select.assign of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.select.assign:11 of
msgid "LiteFrame with the new or replaced columns.  Row order is preserved."
msgstr "包含新列或替换列的 LiteFrame。行顺序得以保留。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.select.assign of
msgid "返回类型"
